@startuml
title Catalog：产品目录模块（skeleton）
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "api" {
  interface CatalogQueryService {
    +listPublishedProducts()
    +findProduct(code)
    +listManagedProducts(query)
    +resolveProductsForAssetFamily(familyCode)
  }
  interface CatalogAdminService {
    +createProduct(command, actor)
    +updateProduct(command, actor)
    +publishProduct(productId, actor)
    +disableProduct(productId, actor)
  }
  class ProductSummary <<record>>
  class ProductDetail <<record>>
  class ProductStatus <<enum>>
}

package "application" {
  class MockCatalog <<skeleton mock>>
}

MockCatalog ..|> CatalogQueryService
MockCatalog ..|> CatalogAdminService
MockCatalog ..> ProductDetail : 保存 Mock 产品
ProductDetail --> ProductSummary
ProductSummary --> ProductStatus

note right of MockCatalog
当前实现把产品保存在内存 Map 中。
将来可替换为数据库实现。
end note
@enduml
